📌 Project Overview

An interactive Hospital Emergency Room Dashboard created in Microsoft Excel to analyze patient volume, waiting time, patient satisfaction, and emergency room performance.

🎯 Objectives

Analyze overall patient volume
Monitor patient waiting time
Track daily patient trends
Analyze patient satisfaction
Identify patterns in emergency room activity
Present key performance indicators through an interactive dashboard

📊 Key KPIs

Total Number of Patients
Average Patient Waiting Time
Patient Satisfaction Score
Daily Patient Volume
Daily Waiting Time
Patient Trends

🛠️ Tools & Skills

Microsoft Excel
Pivot Tables
Pivot Charts
Data Analysis
KPI Reporting
Data Visualization
Trend Analysis
Interactive Dashboard
